The inventory is the check. A CLAUSE row says a marker sits in the
same sentence and says nothing about whether it defines the term,
which is the taste gate's lesson in a second place. A BARE row has
no marker at all and is the finding. A frequency row a grade rules
ordinary goes in ORDINARY_TERMS, with the grade that ruled it.

