One paper cannot overturn itself. Each hit is a sentence whose own
words name the overturned end as work this section cites, so the
repair is to drop the pairing rather than to reword it: the
relation is usually `refines` and the item belongs in the new work.
A clean exit is not a verdict on the section. The figure under the
wrong paper and the mislabelled two-paper edge both need the
abstracts, and they are the claims pass's seventh question.

